{"1890780": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Szrot", "steam_appid": 1890780, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Szrot is a CaRPG set in the 1980s in a country that no longer exists - Yugoslavia.</i> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890780/extras/d4364c9b14902ccb7fefdee91cdbd96e.avif?t=1770313582\" width=1560 height=668 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Szrot: Polish word for busted old car]</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Belgrade, Yugoslavia, 1980s. You're a young driver armed with nothing but your dad’s old car and an appetite for speed. Navigate the brutalist utopian cityscape, immerse yourself in underground street racing and help friends in need.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For you and your peers, street racing isn't just a hobby—it's a lifestyle. In the blur of speed, you can pretend the world isn’t collapsing, pretend you still have time to figure out what comes next. Push your driving skills to the limit in an adrenaline-fueled pursuit of excitement and liberation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890780/extras/cf5c837a6709c2f05736293305faf73f.avif?t=1770313582\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890780/extras_big/cf5c837a6709c2f05736293305faf73f.webp?t=1770313582 width=1560 height=126 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🏁 High-Speed Street Battles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race through the socialist utopia of Novi Beograd. Explore a hand-crafted level, challenge opponents on the fly, and push your machine to the limit in adrenaline-fueled evening duels.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🔧 Deep Customization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swap parts, switch out the engine, experiment with builds, and create your dream szrot. Every upgrade changes both your performance and your identity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🌆 A Vivid Late-80s Yugoslav Setting</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cruise through atmospheric districts inspired by real Belgrade streets. Blocks, huge towers, and industrial backroads create a world that’s equal parts nostalgic and electric.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🎮 An homage to PS1 era graphics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by classic PlayStation visuals, every street, car, and character is modelled and textured using the same techniques and methods as back in the hay-day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890780/extras/53f51d97043a7238286acc7390b57ce4.avif?t=1770313582\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890780/extras_big/53f51d97043a7238286acc7390b57ce4.webp?t=1770313582 width=1560 height=1170 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>📜 Main quests and side quests</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between races, you’ll meet and interact with many characters from all walks of life. From grandmas needing help with groceries to shady people looking to profit from worsening conditions. These quests will give you an insight into the everyday life of the citizens of Belgrade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890780/extras/8990b6aaa71f2eced7e8e68d849b0d37.avif?t=1770313582\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890780/extras_big/8990b6aaa71f2eced7e8e68d849b0d37.webp?t=1770313582 width=1560 height=1170 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph